#### Phase 4: Monitoring and Operations Setup (Week 3-4)

**Step 10: Lenses.io Registration**

```bash
# Register connector in Lenses.io
lenses-cli connect cluster register \
  --name kafka-connect-prod \
  --url http://kafka-connect.kafka-connect.svc.cluster.local:8083 \
  --display-name "Production Kafka Connect"

# Configure connector monitoring
lenses-cli connect connector alert \
  --connector claims-postgres-cdc \
  --condition "status != RUNNING" \
  --severity critical \
  --channel "#kafka-alerts"
```

